  "2025 Q10": {"skill":"Graphing a linear model of depth against time, then matching a container to a graph.","method":"(a) 3 marks, (b) 2 marks, (c) 2 marks","moves":["Where does the line start, and how much does it rise each minute?","(a) Start at 4 cm and draw a straight line rising 3 cm each minute.","(a) Stop the line at 8 minutes.","(b)(i) Name the relationship your graph shows.","(b)(ii) Which quantity depends on the other?","(c) Where is the container narrow and where is it wide? Match that to how fast the depth rises."],"marks":[0,2,1,1,1,2],"shows":[null,"starting depth of 4 centimetres identifiable from graph","final point on graph at \\((8, 28)\\)",null,null,null],"watch":{"at":2,"text":"The line must stop at 8 minutes, not carry on."}},
